<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>五行生克 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%8C%E7%94%9F%E5%85%8B/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.2</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 27 Jan 2026 11:54:39 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%8C%E7%94%9F%E5%85%8B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>五行生克篇第三十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-38/</link><pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 10:26:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-38/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过雷公与岐伯的对话，打破了五行生克的一般常理，详细论述了在人体生理病理中，五行生克出现的&lt;strong&gt;六种变局&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>脾土篇第二十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-28/</link><pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 14:22:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-28/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，深入阐述了脾土与各种“火”的关系，特别是&lt;strong&gt;命门之火&lt;/strong&gt;对脾胃生理功能的决定性作用，并论述了“焦土”的病理传变及治法。</description></item><item><title>心火篇第二十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-27/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Dec 2025 13:28:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-27/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，系统论述了“心火”（君火）的生理特性、病理传变、心肾相交的机制以及治疗原则，特别强调了“静”的重要性以及肾水对心火的决定性作用。</description></item><item><title>肾水篇第二十六</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-26/</link><pubDate>Sat, 06 Dec 2025 12:22:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-26/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，极深刻地剖析了&lt;strong&gt;肾水&lt;/strong&gt;在人体五行生克中的核心地位，阐述了肺肾关系、水火既济的机制，以及“肾有补无泻”的理论依据。</description></item><item><title>肝木篇第二十五</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-25/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 16:32:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-25/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，深入探讨了肝（木）的生理病理特性，特别是**“肝郁”**（木郁）的成因、传变规律以及治疗原则，修正了单纯“补肾养肝”的局限性。</description></item><item><title>十二正经之井荣俞原经合穴总结</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu-3-2/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 11:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu-3-2/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%92%88%E7%81%B8%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/">针灸笔记</category><description>五输穴（井、荣、俞、经、合）与原穴构成经络治疗核心，井穴治脏病、荣穴调色病、俞穴疗时病、经穴主音病、合穴理饮食病，结合五行生克与季节调养实现“治未病”，通过四肢远端穴位安全干预疾病传变。</description></item><item><title>跟倪师学黄帝内经笔记之四：病变之因</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE0-4%E8%B7%9F%E5%80%AA%E5%B8%88%E5%AD%A6%E9%BB%84%E5%B8%9D%E5%86%85%E7%BB%8F%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%9B%E7%97%85%E5%8F%98%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%A0/</link><pubDate>Sun, 04 May 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE0-4%E8%B7%9F%E5%80%AA%E5%B8%88%E5%AD%A6%E9%BB%84%E5%B8%9D%E5%86%85%E7%BB%8F%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%9B%E7%97%85%E5%8F%98%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%A0/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/">素问笔记</category><description>系统阐述了中医&amp;quot;天人相应&amp;quot;的发病观，指出人体疾病源于内外因交互作用：外因以六淫（风寒暑湿燥火）为主，内因包括情志失调、饮食失节、劳逸失度等，通过阴阳失衡、五行生克、六经传变等病理机制，表现为表里寒热虚实错杂的证候体系，其核心在于&amp;quot;正气存内，邪不可干&amp;quot;的发病原理，强调疾病发生发展具有时序性（四时病传）、层次性（由表入里）、相关性（五脏互传）三大规律，形成了一套涵盖六经辨证、八纲辨证、脏腑辨证的完整病理认知体系。</description></item><item><title>刺热篇第三十二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE32%E5%88%BA%E7%83%AD%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C/</link><pubDate>Sun, 02 Mar 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE32%E5%88%BA%E7%83%AD%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与岐伯系统论述伤寒病的六经传变规律、预后判断及治疗禁忌，揭示&amp;quot;阳经先受邪&amp;quot;&amp;ldquo;六经次第传变&amp;quot;的病理过程，强调&amp;quot;汗下分治&amp;quot;的治疗原则和&amp;quot;食复&amp;quot;的调养禁忌。</description></item></channel></rss>